==Description==
'''Ducky Doom''', internally referred to as '''Ducky Doom Chasing''', is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Ducky Revenge Event]]]. It is obtained from Level 29 of the premium track, which had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|980}} or {{Robux|88}} ({{Robux|74}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|13,490}} or {{Robux|2,240}} ({{Robux|1,890}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Ducky Doom''' showcases the [[Ducky D00M III]] chasing the default [[Scout]]. It plays a sound of the [[Ducky D00M III]] laughing.

==Trivia==
*'''Ducky Doom''' is incorrectly named, as it uses "''doom''" instead of "''D00M''".

